        "以整份试样中的铝计量，包含酸溶与不溶部分。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/chemical-element> ;
    skos:notation "AL"^^stl:ChemicalElementCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "Total aluminium"@en,
        "全铝"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/chemical-element> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/chemical-element/ALS> a skos:Concept ;
