        "利用电解沉积在钢基板表面形成的锌层。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/coating-type> ;
    skos:notation "EG"^^stl:CoatingTypeCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "Electrodeposited zinc coating"@en,
        "电镀锌层"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/coating-type> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/coating-type/GA> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Galvannealed coating"@en,
        "锌铁合金镀层"@zh ;
    dcterms:source <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/std/gbt-2518-2019> ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/process/rolling-codes> ;
    skos:altLabel "GA"@en,
        "GA"@zh ;
    skos:definition "A zinc-iron coating formed by alloying a hot-dip zinc deposit with iron from the substrate."@en,
        "热镀锌后通过合金化处理，使锌层与基板中的铁形成锌铁合金镀层。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/coating-type> ;
    skos:notation "GA"^^stl:CoatingTypeCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "Galvannealed coating"@en,
        "锌铁合金镀层"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/coating-type> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/coating-type/GI> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Zinc coating"@en,
        "纯锌镀层"@zh ;
    dcterms:source <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/std/gbt-2518-2019> ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/process/rolling-codes> ;
    skos:altLabel "GI"@en,
        "GI"@zh ;
    skos:definition "A predominantly zinc layer left by hot dipping, distinct from a subsequently alloyed zinc-iron layer."@en,
        "带钢热浸锌后形成的以锌为主的镀层，可与再经合金化处理的锌铁镀层区分。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/coating-type> ;
    skos:notation "GI"^^stl:CoatingTypeCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "Zinc coating"@en,
        "纯锌镀层"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/coating-type> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/coating-type/ORGANIC> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Organic coating"@en,
        "有机涂层"@zh ;
    dcterms:source <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/source/industry-practice> ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/process/rolling-codes> ;
    skos:definition "A film formed from an organic coating material on steel or on an underlying metallic layer."@en,
        "由有机涂料在钢基板或其金属镀层表面形成的膜层。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/coating-type> ;
    skos:notation "ORGANIC"^^stl:CoatingTypeCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "Organic coating"@en,
        "有机涂层"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/coating-type> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/coating-type/ZM> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Zinc-aluminium-magnesium coating"@en,
        "锌铝镁镀层"@zh ;
    dcterms:source <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/source/industry-practice> ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/process/rolling-codes> ;
    skos:altLabel "ZM"@en,
        "ZM"@zh ;
    skos:definition "A hot-dip metallic layer based on zinc and alloyed with aluminium and magnesium."@en,
        "以锌为基、铝和镁为合金组分的热浸金属镀层。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/coating-type> ;
    skos:notation "ZM"^^stl:CoatingTypeCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "Zinc-aluminium-magnesium coating"@en,
        "锌铝镁镀层"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/coating-type> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/contribution-evidence/ESTIMATED> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "estimated share"@en,
        "估算份额"@zh ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/core/codes> ;
    skos:definition "The fraction comes from a documented allocation rule or estimate."@en,
        "份额依据有说明的规则或估算模型确定。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/contribution-evidence> ;
    skos:notation "ESTIMATED"^^stl:ContributionEvidenceCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "estimated share"@en,
        "估算份额"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/contribution-evidence> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/contribution-evidence/MEASURED> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "measured share"@en,
        "实测份额"@zh ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/core/codes> ;
    skos:definition "The attributed fraction rests on traceable measurements such as mass or length."@en,
        "份额以可查的称量或长度测量记录为根据。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/contribution-evidence> ;
    skos:notation "MEASURED"^^stl:ContributionEvidenceCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "measured share"@en,
        "实测份额"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/contribution-evidence> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/contribution-evidence/UNKNOWN> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "unknown share"@en,
        "份额未知"@zh ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/core/codes> ;
    skos:definition "Participation of the source is known while its fraction is undetermined."@en,
        "确认该来源参与了产出，但尚无可报告的份额值。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/contribution-evidence> ;
    skos:notation "UNKNOWN"^^stl:ContributionEvidenceCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "unknown share"@en,
        "份额未知"@zh ;
    skos:scopeNote "份额可以留空；已知有两个来源不足以支持均分。"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/contribution-evidence> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/defect-type/BARESPOT> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Bare spot"@en,
        "漏镀"@zh ;
    dcterms:source <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/source/industry-practice> ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/process/rolling-codes> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/defect-type/FLAT> ;
    skos:definition "Local exposure of the substrate where coating coverage is required."@en,
        "要求镀层覆盖的表面因局部缺镀而露出基板的缺陷。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/defect-type> ;
    skos:notation "BARESPOT"^^stl:DefectTypeCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "Bare spot"@en,
        "漏镀"@zh .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/defect-type/CAST> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Cast semiproduct defects"@en,
        "铸坯缺陷"@zh ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/core/codes> ;
    skos:definition "Groups flaws specific to cast stock and its solidification history."@en,
        "按铸坯形态和凝固阶段归集检查记录中的缺陷。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/defect-type> ;
    skos:notation "CAST"^^stl:DefectTypeCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "Cast semiproduct defects"@en,
        "铸坯缺陷"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/defect-type> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/defect-type/COATLOW> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Low coating mass"@en,
        "镀层质量不足"@zh ;
    dcterms:source <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/source/industry-practice> ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/process/rolling-codes> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/defect-type/FLAT> ;
    skos:definition "A coating mass per unit area below the applicable requirement on its specified single-face or combined-face basis."@en,
        "按约定的单面或双面合计口径，单位面积镀层质量低于适用要求的缺陷。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/defect-type> ;
    skos:notation "COATLOW"^^stl:DefectTypeCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "Low coating mass"@en,
        "镀层质量不足"@zh .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/defect-type/EDGECRACK> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "edge crack"@en,
        "边裂"@zh ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/core/codes> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/defect-type/FLAT> ;
    skos:definition "A fissure originating at a flat product edge that may extend towards its interior."@en,
        "板带边缘出现并可向板面内部扩展的裂纹。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/defect-type> ;
    skos:notation "EDGECRACK"^^stl:DefectTypeCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "edge crack"@en,
        "边裂"@zh .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/defect-type/FORGELAP> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Forging lap"@en,
        "锻造折叠"@zh ;
    dcterms:source <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/source/industry-practice> ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/special/forging-codes> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/defect-type/FORGED> ;
    skos:definition "A discontinuity where surface metal folds over during forging and is pressed into the workpiece without bonding."@en,
        "锻压时表层金属翻折并压入锻件，在折叠处留下未结合的界面。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/defect-type> ;
    skos:notation "FORGELAP"^^stl:DefectTypeCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "Forging lap"@en,
        "锻造折叠"@zh .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/defect-type/LONG> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Long product defects"@en,
        "长材缺陷"@zh ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/core/codes> ;
    skos:definition "Groups flaws characterized on rolled bars, rod or sections along their length or profile."@en,
        "归集以轧制棒线或型材的长度方向和断面轮廓为依据的缺陷。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/defect-type> ;
    skos:notation "LONG"^^stl:DefectTypeCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "Long product defects"@en,
        "长材缺陷"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/defect-type> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/defect-type/PIPE> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Tube and pipe defects"@en,
        "钢管缺陷"@zh ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/core/codes> ;
    skos:definition "Groups flaws described by their position in the wall, bore or seam of tubular products."@en,
        "归集以管壁、管腔或焊缝为识别位置的缺陷。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/defect-type> ;
    skos:notation "PIPE"^^stl:DefectTypeCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "Tube and pipe defects"@en,
        "钢管缺陷"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/defect-type> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/defect-type/SCRATCH> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "scratch"@en,
        "划伤"@zh ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/core/codes> ;
    skos:definition "A line of surface damage produced by sliding contact with a harder object."@en,
        "表面接触较硬物体并发生相对滑动所留下的线状损伤。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/defect-type> ;
    skos:notation "SCRATCH"^^stl:DefectTypeCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "scratch"@en,
        "划伤"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/defect-type> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/defect-type/UNDERFILL> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Forging underfill"@en,
        "模锻欠充满"@zh ;
    dcterms:source <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/source/industry-practice> ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/special/forging-codes> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/defect-type/FORGED> ;
    skos:definition "A missing portion of the intended forged contour where metal failed to fill part of the die impression."@en,
        "模锻时金属未充满模膛某一部位，使锻件在该处缺少应成形的轮廓。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/defect-type> ;
    skos:notation "UNDERFILL"^^stl:DefectTypeCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "Forging underfill"@en,
        "模锻欠充满"@zh .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/delivery-condition/ANNEALED> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Annealed"@en,
        "退火态"@zh ;
    dcterms:source <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/std/gbt-7232-2023> ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/core/codes> ;
    skos:definition "Supplies material in the softened or microstructurally adjusted condition of the specified anneal."@en,
        "在规定退火处理后以相应软化或组织调整状态交付。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/delivery-condition> ;
    skos:notation "ANNEALED"^^stl:DeliveryConditionCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "Annealed"@en,
        "退火态"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/delivery-condition> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/delivery-condition/ASROLLED> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "As-rolled"@en,
        "轧制态"@zh ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/core/codes> ;
    skos:definition "Supplies stock in the condition left by rolling and the associated routine cooling."@en,
        "以轧制及其常规冷却后的状态供货，规格另列后续处理时需另行标明。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/delivery-condition> ;
    skos:notation "ASROLLED"^^stl:DeliveryConditionCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "As-rolled"@en,
        "轧制态"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/delivery-condition> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/delivery-condition/FULLHARD> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Full hard"@en,
        "冷硬态"@zh ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/core/codes> ;
    skos:definition "Supplies cold-reduced steel with the work hardening of reduction retained."@en,
        "以冷轧加工硬化的状态交货，保留冷变形带来的强度。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/delivery-condition> ;
    skos:notation "FULLHARD"^^stl:DeliveryConditionCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "Full hard"@en,
        "冷硬态"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/delivery-condition> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/delivery-condition/NORMALIZED> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Normalized"@en,
        "正火态"@zh ;
    dcterms:source <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/std/gbt-7232-2023> ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/core/codes> ;
    skos:definition "Supplies material after a normalizing cycle specified for the delivered product."@en,
        "产品在规定的正火循环后达到订货要求的交货组织。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/delivery-condition> ;
    skos:notation "NORMALIZED"^^stl:DeliveryConditionCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "Normalized"@en,
        "正火态"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/delivery-condition> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/delivery-condition/QT> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Quenched and tempered"@en,
        "淬火回火态"@zh ;
    dcterms:source <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/std/gbt-7232-2023> ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/core/codes> ;
    skos:altLabel "Q+T"@en,
        "Q+T"@zh ;
    skos:definition "Supplies stock after the specified quenching and tempering sequence."@en,
        "以完成规定淬火和回火后的组织与性能交货。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/delivery-condition> ;
    skos:notation "QT"^^stl:DeliveryConditionCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "Quenched and tempered"@en,
        "淬火回火态"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/delivery-condition> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/delivery-condition/SOLUTION> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Solution treated"@en,
        "固溶态"@zh ;
    dcterms:source <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/std/gbt-7232-2023> ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/core/codes> ;
    skos:definition "Supplies an alloy in the solution-treated condition designated in the product specification."@en,
        "交付时材料处于产品规定的固溶处理状态。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/delivery-condition> ;
    skos:notation "SOLUTION"^^stl:DeliveryConditionCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "Solution treated"@en,
        "固溶态"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/delivery-condition> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/delivery-condition/TMCP> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Thermomechanically rolled"@en,
        "热机械轧制态"@zh ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/core/codes> ;
    skos:definition "Delivers properties established by a specified combination of controlled hot deformation and cooling."@en,
        "供方以规定的热变形与冷却组合取得交货性能。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/delivery-condition> ;
    skos:notation "TMCP"^^stl:DeliveryConditionCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "Thermomechanically rolled"@en,
        "热机械轧制态"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/delivery-condition> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/disposition-type/CONCESSION> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "acceptance under concession"@en,
        "让步接收"@zh ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/core/codes> ;
    skos:definition "Authorizes acceptance of a defined deviation for a bounded order, quantity and period under the original specification."@en,
        "对已识别偏差给予有范围和期限的接收授权并保留原规格。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/disposition-type> ;
    skos:notation "CONCESSION"^^stl:DispositionTypeCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "acceptance under concession"@en,
        "让步接收"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/disposition-type> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/disposition-type/DEGRADE> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "downgrade"@en,
        "降级"@zh ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/core/codes> ;
    skos:definition "Assigns the same piece to a lower quality specification while recording its order allocation separately."@en,
        "将同一实物的质量规格调整到较低档次，是否保留原订单由分配记录确定。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/disposition-type> ;
    skos:notation "DEGRADE"^^stl:DispositionTypeCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "downgrade"@en,
        "降级"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/disposition-type> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/disposition-type/HOLD> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "hold"@en,
        "封闭待处理"@zh ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/core/codes> ;
    skos:definition "Suspends further movement or use pending inspection, review or disposition authority."@en,
        "暂时冻结流转，等候检查、复核或处置授权。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/disposition-type> ;
    skos:notation "HOLD"^^stl:DispositionTypeCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "hold"@en,
        "封闭待处理"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/disposition-type> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/disposition-type/REASSIGN> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "reassignment"@en,
        "改判"@zh ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/core/codes> ;
    skos:definition "Supersedes the original allocation and designates the piece for another specification or order line."@en,
        "撤销原适配关系，将同一实物改配给另一规格或订单行。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/disposition-type> ;
    skos:notation "REASSIGN"^^stl:DispositionTypeCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "reassignment"@en,
        "改判"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/disposition-type> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/disposition-type/RELEASE> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "release"@en,
        "放行"@zh ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/core/codes> ;
    skos:definition "Authorizes the piece to proceed to its next approved operation or shipment."@en,
        "授权实物进入规定的下一道作业或发运环节。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/disposition-type> ;
    skos:notation "RELEASE"^^stl:DispositionTypeCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "release"@en,
        "放行"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/disposition-type> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/disposition-type/REWORK> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "rework"@en,
        "返修"@zh ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/core/codes> ;
    skos:definition "Routes the material for corrective processing and the required subsequent inspection."@en,
        "安排对实物采取修复加工并按约定重新检验。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/disposition-type> ;
    skos:notation "REWORK"^^stl:DispositionTypeCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "rework"@en,
        "返修"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/disposition-type> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/disposition-type/SCRAP> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "scrap"@en,
        "报废"@zh ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/core/codes> ;
    skos:definition "Withdraws the material from product use or delivery and directs it to scrap disposition."@en,
        "取消按成品继续使用或交付的资格，将材料导向报废处置。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/disposition-type> ;
    skos:notation "SCRAP"^^stl:DispositionTypeCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "scrap"@en,
        "报废"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/disposition-type> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/equipment-type/AOD> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Argon oxygen decarburization converter"@en,
        "氩氧脱碳炉"@zh ;
    dcterms:source <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/source/industry-practice> ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/process/steelmaking-codes> ;
    skos:definition "A refining vessel with tuyeres supplying oxygen and diluting gas for controlled decarburization."@en,
        "设有风口，可向钢液送入氧气和稀释气体以控制脱碳的精炼炉。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/equipment-type> ;
    skos:notation "AOD"^^stl:EquipmentTypeCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "Argon oxygen decarburization converter"@en,
        "氩氧脱碳炉"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/equipment-type> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/equipment-type/BALL> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Balling unit"@en,
        "造球机"@zh ;
    dcterms:source <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/source/industry-practice> ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/process/ironmaking-codes> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/equipment-type/PELLET> ;
    skos:definition "A unit that builds green balls by rolling moist ore fines in a disc or drum."@en,
        "通过盘内或筒内滚动使润湿矿粉逐渐聚集成生球的设备。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/equipment-type> ;
    skos:notation "BALL"^^stl:EquipmentTypeCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "Balling unit"@en,
        "造球机"@zh .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/equipment-type/BAR> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Bar mill"@en,
        "棒材轧机"@zh ;
    dcterms:source <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/source/industry-practice> ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/process/rolling-codes> ;
    skos:definition "A mill with roll passes that shape stock into solid bar sections."@en,
        "使用适配棒材断面的轧辊孔型将坯料沿长度轧制成棒材的设备。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/equipment-type> ;
    skos:notation "BAR"^^stl:EquipmentTypeCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "Bar mill"@en,
        "棒材轧机"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/equipment-type> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/equipment-type/BCC> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Square billet caster"@en,
        "方坯连铸机"@zh ;
    dcterms:source <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/source/industry-practice> ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/process/casting-codes> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/equipment-type/CASTER> ;
    skos:definition "A caster fitted with moulds that form square billet strands."@en,
        "使用方形断面结晶器连续浇出方坯铸流的设备。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/equipment-type> ;
    skos:notation "BCC"^^stl:EquipmentTypeCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "Square billet caster"@en,
        "方坯连铸机"@zh .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/equipment-type/BLCC> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Bloom caster"@en,
        "大方坯连铸机"@zh ;
    dcterms:source <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/source/industry-practice> ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/process/casting-codes> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/equipment-type/CASTER> ;
    skos:definition "A caster configured to form large square or rectangular strands for blooms."@en,
        "用于浇出大方坯或大矩形坯铸流的连铸机。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/equipment-type> ;
    skos:notation "BLCC"^^stl:EquipmentTypeCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "Bloom caster"@en,
        "大方坯连铸机"@zh .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/equipment-type/BOF> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Basic oxygen furnace"@en,
        "氧气转炉"@zh ;
    dcterms:source <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/source/industry-practice> ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/process/steelmaking-codes> ;
    skos:definition "A tilting primary steelmaking furnace fitted to blow oxygen into or onto the bath."@en,
        "使用氧气吹炼金属熔池并可倾动出钢的炼钢炉座。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/equipment-type> ;
    skos:notation "BOF"^^stl:EquipmentTypeCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "Basic oxygen furnace"@en,
        "氧气转炉"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/equipment-type> .

<https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/equipment-type/CAL> a skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Continuous annealing line"@en,
        "连续退火机组"@zh ;
    dcterms:source <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/source/industry-practice> ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/ontology/process/rolling-codes> ;
    skos:altLabel "CAL"@en,
        "CAL"@zh,
        "连退机组"@zh ;
    skos:definition "A line that anneals moving strip as it passes through successive temperature-controlled zones."@en,
        "使展开的钢带连续通过各温控区，在运行中完成退火的机组。"@zh ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/equipment-type> ;
    skos:notation "CAL"^^stl:EquipmentTypeCode,
        "CA"^^stl:LineSegmentCode ;
    skos:prefLabel "Continuous annealing line"@en,
        "连续退火机组"@zh ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/equipment-type> .

