    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/process-type/HEATTREAT> ;
    skos:definition "Applying a controlled thermal cycle to change the microstructure or relieve work hardening."@en,
        "用受控的加热和冷却循环调整钢材组织或缓解加工硬化。"@zh ;
