    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/process-type/STEELMAKE> ;
    skos:definition "A primary steelmaking segment in which a converter heat is blown with oxygen and tapped."@en,
        "在氧气转炉内吹炼金属熔池并出钢的路线工序段。"@zh ;
