    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/process-type/TRANSFORM> ;
    skos:definition "Forms a continuously withdrawn steel strand that can be cut into lengths."@en,
        "在连续供钢的同时引出逐渐凝固的铸流，获得可切分的坯料。"@zh ;
