    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/ontology-platform/steel/code/process-type/HOTROLL> ;
    skos:definition "Hot rolling stock into individual plates through spreading or reduction passes."@en,
        "将热坯轧成可逐张追踪的中厚板，可包括展宽与减薄道次。"@zh ;
